{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22172","headline":"新构亭台示诸弟侄 · 白居易","name":"新构亭台示诸弟侄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平台高数尺，台上结茅茨。\n东西疏二牖，南北开两扉。\n芦帘前後卷，竹簟当中施。\n清泠白石枕，疏凉黄葛衣。\n开襟向风坐，夏日如秋时。\n啸傲颇有趣，窥临不知疲。\n东窗对华山，三峰碧参差。\n南檐当渭水，卧见云帆飞。\n仰摘枝上果，俯折畦中葵。\n足以充饥渴，何必慕甘肥。\n况有好羣从，旦夕相追随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}